      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "British designer Phoebe Philo's eponymous label has officially launched its new 'Collection E' line since June. Continuing Philo's signature sculptural tailoring and minimalist aesthetic, the season's standout Gig bag now comes in a smaller size and suede iterations, while the new Glove and Bean bags showcase soft leathers and clean silhouettes, striking a poised balance between utility and feminine strength.",
